&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:16.3pt;padding-right:7.2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;重要セクターすべて（不動産・建設、自動車・運輸、エネルギー）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
