  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingDividendTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;３　配当に関する事項&lt;br/&gt;（１）当連結会計年度中の配当金支払額&lt;/p&gt;
